07_scheme_performance.csv	Scheme performance and risk metrics
08_investor_transactions.csv	Investor transaction data
09_portfolio_holdings.csv	Portfolio holding information
10_benchmark_indices.csv	Benchmark index information

The datasets were organized into raw and processed directories to maintain separation between source data and cleaned analytical data.

